Lean-to-Rust compiler design reference (ideas, not imported code)
---------------------------------------------------------------
conao3/lean-rs: https://github.com/conao3/lean-rs
Reference release: v0.3.0 (2026-11-09)
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

The compiler design review draws on lean-rs's use of elaborated Lean compiler
representations, source-identifiable generated Rust, reproducible generated
modules, explicit reporting of unsupported exports, and Cargo builds that do
not require Lean at runtime. These ideas are adapted to this repository's
single source-grounded, compositional compiler and its original Lean
BitProgram instruction and trace-preservation requirements.

No lean-rs source code is imported by this attribution change, and no second
compiler/backend is maintained. If code is copied or adapted later, record its
exact upstream path and revision and retain applicable Apache-2.0 notices.
